# Option 3 — Functional toolbar: filter input replaces the prose

Keep a top row, but make it earn its space: left side becomes a filter/search
input instead of descriptive text. Actions stay right. Description deleted
(or empty-state only).

```
┌ 🔍 Filter labels…                  ┐   [◻ Archived]   [ + New label ]
└────────────────────────────────────┘
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ (● Urgent)                                                    ✎  │
│ (● Backlog)                                                   ✎  │
│ (● Blocked)                                                   ✎  │
│ (● Waiting)                                                   ✎  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

"Archived" becomes a toggle chip in the toolbar; when on, archived rows render
dimmed inline (badge per row) instead of a second card:

```
┌ 🔍 Filter labels…                  ┐   [■ Archived]   [ + New label ]
└────────────────────────────────────┘
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ (● Urgent)                                                    ✎  │
│ (● Backlog)                                                   ✎  │
│ (● Old-tag)                              [archived]           ✎  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

Concepts tab: same strip above the graph canvas —

```
┌ 🔍 Find concept…                   ┐   [◻ Archived]   [ + New concept ]
└────────────────────────────────────┘
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      ( graph canvas )                            │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

+ row stops being decorative; filtering scales as vocab grows
+ kills the second "Archived" card entirely (inline dimmed rows)
- most new code of the three (filter state, inline archived rendering)
